<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Andrew Corp started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Andrew Corp started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it initiated coverage of Andrew Corp with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- set a target price of $33.</p>
<p>-- said expects June quarter results to reflect favorable revenue, earnings and order trends after disappointing March quarter.</p>
<p>-- said recent stock pull-back presents attractive buying opportunity.</p>
<p>-- Andrew Corp gained 13/16 to 29-1/2.</p>
</text>
